          "commit": "f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954",
          "git_sha": "47dcce35403637733bd07c073d98800511c0373b",
          "line_end": 123,
          "line_start": 121,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "funador/claude-code-merge-queue",
          "url": "https://github.com/funador/claude-code-merge-queue/blob/f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954/README.md#L121-L123"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1e4659daa9e1784fd3752365afad852eb2469fbd6edc3a0372982b237c4d93a7",
        "slc_b779047b607b743408ea75cd5f0ba68c275b5b03caf040c3eafa9f995eddb937",
        "slc_eb3f59084ad0d61cd10da7e6998787bd1e7a1ea1e2f942974632a443a8943687"
      ],
      "text": "Blocked pushes can be bypassed via a single environment variable (CLAUDE_CODE_MERGE_QUEUE_EMERGENCY_PUSH=1), which the README notes is a convention, not a guarantee against an adversarial agent."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_eede019b57cccd75d2bc8473b64439d724ba912b6367947fdb9dd131c21374bf",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954",
          "git_sha": "47dcce35403637733bd07c073d98800511c0373b",
          "line_end": 147,
          "line_start": 130,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "funador/claude-code-merge-queue",
          "url": "https://github.com/funador/claude-code-merge-queue/blob/f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954/README.md#L130-L147"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fa86ac5591f52e22e275ffbf65e968810276a9a59b9eb3f074fd8d894a2d12aa"
      ],
      "text": "No human review occurs before landing; checkCommand passing is the only gate, and the tool cannot distinguish a real test suite from a trivially passing command."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6f657d7ee898b7731a68c0198890d613ca0c504c9b7f9dd5dea2be7c5ee40f24",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954",
          "git_sha": "47dcce35403637733bd07c073d98800511c0373b",
          "line_end": 147,
          "line_start": 130,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "funador/claude-code-merge-queue",
          "url": "https://github.com/funador/claude-code-merge-queue/blob/f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954/README.md#L130-L147"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fa86ac5591f52e22e275ffbf65e968810276a9a59b9eb3f074fd8d894a2d12aa"
      ],
      "text": "The queue is single-machine: the FIFO lock lives in local temp storage, so concurrent landings from two machines only get git's ordinary non-fast-forward rejection."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3570e6f71bd9beea564a6a38c32ea12780b5d02d3657cd2e4ad253528b637b26",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954",
          "git_sha": "47dcce35403637733bd07c073d98800511c0373b",
          "line_end": 147,
          "line_start": 130,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "funador/claude-code-merge-queue",
          "url": "https://github.com/funador/claude-code-merge-queue/blob/f77757479cab8031774495c4207647709199a954/README.md#L130-L147"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fa86ac5591f52e22e275ffbf65e968810276a9a59b9eb3f074fd8d894a2d12aa"
      ],
      "text": "Locks are crash-safe via PID liveness rather than timeouts, and a slow checkCommand caps throughput since the FIFO lock is held for its entire duration."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_62b445cae0724ccc6faf14d5ae3d3c2e55c19b7814a2d0128a95f2eb25523b2a",
