  "summary": "A local, zero-cost merge queue npm package (TypeScript, Node >=18, zero runtime deps) that serializes landings from parallel Claude Code agents via numbered worktree lanes, a FIFO push queue, and a pre-push check gate. Evidence is README-only; behavior claims are documented, not code-inspected.",
